OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals make masks plea after   
OL,4,Aincrease in flu                        
OL,6,FThe measure was "due to a significant  
OL,7,Fincrease in flu and other acute        
OL,8,Frespiratory virus infections in our    
OL,9,Fhospitals", the trust said.            
